#. ここには…何もないようだぞ。
msgctxt "0001 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "There's nothing here of interest, don't you agree?"
msgstr ""

#. 他を探してみろ…
msgctxt "0002 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "You should go look somewhere else."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>外の情報に飢えている…
#. ここでテレビでも見られればな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm starving for information from the outside world.\n"
"If only there was a TV that worked...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんな監視カメラで見張られる生活が…
#. 一体、いつまで続くんだよ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>How long am I going to be stuck here, being watched by\n"
"all these cameras...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この手紙によれば…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>According to this letter...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>希望ヶ峰学園は…
#. すでに<CLT><CLT 3>学校としての役割を終えていた<CLT><CLT 4>。<CLT>
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hope's Peak Academy had <CLT><CLT 3>stopped functioning as a\n"
"school<CLT><CLT 4>.<CLT>\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>しかも、最近って訳じゃなくて、
#. 下手すれば<CLT><CLT 3>１年以上も前<CLT><CLT 4>…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And what's more, it didn't even happen recently.\n"
"Apparently it closed down <CLT><CLT 3>over a year ago<CLT><CLT 4>.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>きっと、黒幕は無人になった希望ヶ峰学園を乗っ取り、
#. このコロシアイ学園生活の舞台を作り上げたんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The mastermind probably took over the abandoned school\n"
"in order to start this \"killing game\"...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>学園内にボク達以外の生徒がいない理由は、
#. この学園がすでに閉鎖されていたから…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Which explains why there aren't any other students\n"
"here—because it's not a real school.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして、希望ヶ峰学園が閉鎖に追い込まれた
#. <CLT><CLT 3>“深刻な問題”<CLT><CLT 4>…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And then there's these \"<CLT><CLT 3>serious issues<CLT><CLT 4>\" that forced\n"
"the school to close down in the first place...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それって、ボクらの身に降りかかっているこの状況と、
#. 何か関係あるのかな…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Is there any connection between that and what's\n"
"happening to us now...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ……………
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4><CLT><CLT 3>黒幕の目的<CLT><CLT 4>…
#. ボクらをここに閉じ込め、こんな事をさせてる目的…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4><CLT><CLT 3>The mastermind's motive<CLT><CLT 4>... If we can figure out why\n"
"they would want to imprison us all here...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それを解き明かせば、
#. ボクらはここから出られるのだろうか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...will that be enough to get us out of here?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それとも……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Or...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>棚にはびっしりと本が詰め込まれている。
#. けどそれ以前に、この棚…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The shelf is packed tight with books. But looking at\n"
"it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>埃がもの凄いな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...the whole thing is incredibly dusty.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、そんなことを気にしている場合じゃない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But now is no time to be worried about that...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>棚にはびっしりと本が詰め込まれている。
#. けどそれ以前に、この棚…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The shelf is packed tight with books. But looking at\n"
"it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>埃がもの凄いな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...the whole thing is incredibly dusty.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、そんなことを気にしている場合じゃない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But now is no time to be worried about that...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>棚にはびっしりと本が詰め込まれている。
#. けどそれ以前に、この棚…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The shelf is packed tight with books. But looking at\n"
"it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>埃がもの凄いな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...the whole thing is incredibly dusty.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、そんなことを気にしている場合じゃない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But now is no time to be worried about that...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>机の上にはみっちりと埃が積もってる…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's a thick layer of dust on top of the desk.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この図書室は長い事、
#. 放ったらかしになってたんだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It looks like this library's been neglected for a\n"
"pretty long time.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でもそれは、今気にする事じゃないか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But I have more important things to worry about right\n"
"now...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これは…電気スタンドか。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's...a desk lamp.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>確かに、この図書室は薄暗いし、
#. これは重宝しそうだけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The library's definitely pretty dark. I imagine this\n"
"would come in pretty handy, but...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あれ、コードがコンセントに届いてないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...the cord doesn't quite reach the power outlet.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. おい、そっちにも何もないぞ…
msgctxt "0031 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Hey. There's nothing worthwhile over there."
msgstr ""

#. この俺が調べているんだ。
#. 間違いない。
msgctxt "0032 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "I've already checked, so there can be no mistake..."
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0033 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0034 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0035 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
